has numbers
Reverse Numbers
	ReverseList(1, 2, 3, 4).Reverse is (4, 3, 2, 1)
	for Range(0, numbers.Length).Reverse
		numbers(index)
Added(other Numbers) Numbers
	ReverseList(1, 2).Added((10, 20)) is (11, 22)
	ReverseList(1, 2, 3).Added((10, 20)) is Error
	ReverseList(1, 2).Added((10, 20))(1) is 22
	for numbers
		value + other(index)
Reported(other Numbers) Text
	ReverseList(1, 2, 3).Reported((10, 20)).Split("\n").Length is 3
	ReverseList(1, 2).Reported((10, 20)) is ""
	let added = Added(other)
	added is Error then added to Text else ""
